zlib 1.3.1, unmodified: https://github.com/madler/zlib/releases/download/v1.3.1/zlib-1.3.1.tar.gz
(sha256 9a93b2b7dfdac77ceba5a558a580e74667dd6fede4585b91eefb60f03b72df23). Only the files deflate and inflate need
are kept (no gz* file I/O, no contrib, no examples); zutil.c still includes gzguts.h, kept for that. Built by the
Makefile with -DZ_PREFIX into build/libxszlib.a, linked only into programs that import node:zlib.
